course: dictionary
lesson: 11235
title: Workforce and the people who do the work
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A workforce is all the people who work for a company, factory or organisation. Plain words for it are the workers or the staff. «A factory has a workforce of 200» means 200 people work there.
explain: The word can also describe a whole country. The workforce of a country is all the people who are able to work there, so it is much bigger than one building.
explain: In maths word problems the workforce is the total number of workers. «A workforce of 240 is split into 8 equal teams» means you divide 240 people by 8 to find how many are in each team: 30.
explain: In business you may hear «workforce adjustment», which means layoffs, when people lose their jobs. It is common in Canada. The clues around it tell you the meaning, so read the whole sentence.
fact: Workforce means the workers, or the staff.
fact: «A workforce of 240» means 240 workers in total.
fact: Workforce is usually singular: a workforce, several workforces.
fact: «Workforce adjustment» (business jargon, common in Canada) means layoffs.
fact: A good check is to swap in «workers» or «staff» and see if the sentence still makes sense.
exercise: «A factory has a workforce of 200.» How many people work at the factory? | 2000 | 2 | 20 | *200
exercise: «A workforce of 240 is split into 8 equal teams.» How many workers are in each team? | 248 | 232 | 32 | *30
exercise: Which plain word means the same as workforce? | Holidays | Buildings | Machines | *Workers
test: «The workforce of a country is all the people who are able to work there.» What does this sentence tell you? | Only the children of the country | Only the people in one factory | *Everyone who can work in that country | The number of cars in the country
test: A friend in Canada says, «Workforce adjustment means layoffs.» What does this mean? | Building new factories | People getting a pay rise | *People losing their jobs | Teams playing sport together
exam: A workforce of 240 is split into 8 equal teams, but 30 workers are off sick. How many workers are left to work? | 200 | 230 | 270 | *210
